# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Material kept locally, out of the repository ----------------------------
# The design canvas the site was built from, delivered as an archive, and the
# briefs written for one piece of work at a time. What they established is in
# website/ now, served rather than unpacked.
Web/
Gentoo portage UI prototype.zip
prompt-*.md
*.dc.html

# --- Left behind by a checkout of `main` -------------------------------------
# Switching to the application branch and building it leaves the package tree,
# its caches and the compiled translations in the working directory. They
# belong to `main`; here they are leftovers of moving between the two.
gentstore/

# --- Build output ------------------------------------------------------------
# What build.py renders and Cloudflare Pages publishes. Generated from the
# content files and the templates; never edited, never committed.
dist/

# --- Tooling caches and test leftovers ---------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Local editor / tooling noise --------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
.DS_Store

# --- Runtime output ----------------------------------------------------------
# The service logs to /var/log/gentstore-website.log; a stray run redirected
# into the working tree should not become a commit.
*.log
